    "Olaylar uygulaman\u0131n i\u00e7inde kal\u0131r; istersen ayn\u0131 uyar\u0131y\u0131 telefonunun uyar\u0131 merkezine veya Telegram'a da g\u00f6nder. Hi\u00e7biri zorunlu de\u011fil.": "Fanann imeachta\u00ed laistigh den aip; m\u00e1s mian leat, seol an rabhadh c\u00e9anna go l\u00e1rionad f\u00f3gra\u00ed do ghuth\u00e1in n\u00f3 go Telegram. N\u00ed g\u00e1 aon cheann acu.", // EN: Events stay inside the app; if you want, send the same alert to your phone's notification centre or to Telegram. None of these is required.
    "Konu ad\u0131 yaz, hesap gerekmez": "Cuir isteach ainm \u00e1bhair \u2014 n\u00edl cuntas ag teast\u00e1il", // EN: Enter a topic name — no account needed
    "Konu (topic)": "\u00c1bhar", // EN: Topic
    "Bildirimler ntfy.sh \u00fczerinde bu konuya g\u00f6nderilir; konu ad\u0131n\u0131 sadece sen biliyorsan bildirimi sadece sen al\u0131rs\u0131n.": "Foilseofar f\u00f3gra\u00ed ar an \u00e1bhar seo ar ntfy.sh; m\u00e1s eol duit amh\u00e1in ainm an \u00e1bhair, is t\u00fa amh\u00e1in a fhaigheann iad.", // EN: Notifications are published to this topic on ntfy.sh; if only you know the topic name, only you receive them.
    "E-posta": "R\u00edomhphost", // EN: Email
    "Uyar\u0131lar hesab\u0131n\u0131n e-posta adresine gider": "Seoltar rabhaidh chuig seoladh r\u00edomhphoist do chuntais", // EN: Alerts are sent to your account's email address
    "Bulut oturumu a\u00e7\u0131kken kendi adresine g\u00f6nderilir; saklanacak anahtar yok.": "Seoltar chuig do sheoladh f\u00e9in fad a bheith s\u00ednithe isteach; n\u00ed st\u00f3r\u00e1iltear aon r\u00fan san aip.", // EN: Sent to your own address while signed in; no secrets are stored in the app.
    "G\u00f6nderilecek adres": "Faighteoir", // EN: Recipient
    "Cihazlar Aras\u0131 Bildirim": "F\u00f3gra\u00ed Trasghl\u00e9as", // EN: Cross-device Notifications
    "Aile \u00fcyesinin uyar\u0131s\u0131, o ki\u015finin uygulamas\u0131 kapal\u0131yken de bildirim merkezine d\u00fc\u015fer": "Tagann fol\u00e1ireamh ball teaghlaigh isteach san ionad f\u00f3gra fi\u00fa nuair a bh\u00edonn an aip d\u00fanta", // EN: A family member's alert arrives in the notification centre even when the app is closed
    "Di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin ve kendi di\u011fer cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n bildirim merkezine gider; al\u0131c\u0131 bu kanal\u0131 kendi cihaz\u0131nda a\u00e7m\u0131\u015f olmal\u0131.": "T\u00e9ann s\u00e9 chuig ionaid f\u00f3gra do bhaill eile agus d'ionaid f\u00f3gra\u00ed do ghl\u00e9asanna eile; n\u00ed m\u00f3r don fhaighteoir an cain\u00e9al seo a chumas\u00fa ar a ghl\u00e9as.", // EN: Goes to other members' and your other devices' notification centres; the recipient must have this channel enabled on their device.
    "Kendi sunucuna JSON POST \u2014 geli\u015fmi\u015f": "JSON POST chuig do fhreastala\u00ed f\u00e9in - chun cinn", // EN: JSON POST to your own server — advanced
