    "A\u00e7\u0131k kanal": "Oscail cain\u00e9al", // EN: Open channel
    "Hi\u00e7bir kanal a\u00e7\u0131k de\u011fil.": "N\u00edl aon chain\u00e9al cumasaithe.", // EN: No channel is enabled.
