    "Sipari\u015fle ilgili sorun mu var? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "Fadhb le hord\u00fa? Seol aiseolas", // EN: Problem with an order? Send feedback
    "Haz\u0131r olanlar \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r durumda; haz\u0131r olmayanlar \"Yak\u0131nda\" olarak i\u015faretlidir.": "Oibr\u00edonn earra\u00ed r\u00e9idh anois; t\u00e1 earra\u00ed nach bhfuil r\u00e9idh marc\u00e1ilte le \"Ag teacht go luath\".", // EN: Ready items work now; items that are not ready are marked "Coming soon".
    "Apple Watch Deste\u011fi Yak\u0131nda": "Taca\u00edocht le Faire Apple Ag Teacht Go Luath", // EN: Apple Watch Support Coming Soon
    "NEXUS hen\u00fcz Apple Watch uygulamas\u0131 i\u00e7ermiyor. Yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bile\u011finden senaryolar\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131p kritik uyar\u0131lar\u0131 g\u00f6rebileceksin.": "N\u00edl aip Faire Apple san \u00e1ireamh go f\u00f3ill i NEXUS. Nuair a scaoilfear \u00e9, beidh t\u00fa in ann c\u00e1sanna a rith agus f\u00f3gra\u00ed critici\u00fala a fheice\u00e1il \u00f3 do mhuine\u00e1l.", // EN: NEXUS does not include an Apple Watch app yet. Once released, you will be able to run scenarios and see critical alerts from your wrist.
    "Bug\u00fcn Ne Yapabilirsin": "Cad is F\u00e9idir Leat a Dh\u00e9anamh Inniu", // EN: What You Can Do Today
    "Kritik olaylar i\u00e7in bildirimleri a\u00e7\u0131k tut; uyar\u0131lar\u0131 telefonunda hemen g\u00f6r\u00fcrs\u00fcn.": "Coinnigh f\u00f3gra\u00ed ar si\u00fal le haghaidh imeachta\u00ed critici\u00fala; feiceann t\u00fa f\u00f3gra\u00ed ar do fh\u00f3n l\u00e1ithreach.", // EN: Keep notifications on for critical events; you see alerts on your phone right away.
    "Saatinde bu bildirimlerin g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcp g\u00f6r\u00fcnmeyece\u011fi iPhone'unun Watch ayarlar\u0131na ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r; NEXUS saate \u00f6zel bir \u015fey g\u00f6ndermez.": "Braitheann air an bhfuil na f\u00f3gra\u00ed seo le feice\u00e1il ar do faire ar socruithe Faire do iPhone; n\u00ed sheolann NEXUS aon rud sonrach chuig an faire.", // EN: Whether these notifications show on your watch depends on your iPhone's Watch settings; NEXUS sends nothing specific to the watch.
    "Bildirim Ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 A\u00e7": "Oscail Socruithe F\u00f3gra", // EN: Open Notification Settings
    "Anahtar\u0131 kopyala": "C\u00f3ipe\u00e1il eochair", // EN: Copy key
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131nda a\u00e7": "Oscail san aip \u00fadaraitheora", // EN: Open in authenticator app
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131na eri\u015fimini kaybedersen giri\u015fte kod istenece\u011fi i\u00e7in hesab\u0131na giremezsin. Bu anahtar\u0131 g\u00fcvenli bir yere kaydet.": "Mura mbeidh rochtain agat ar do aip \u00fadaraitheora n\u00ed bheidh t\u00fa in ann s\u00edni\u00fa isteach, toisc go bhfuil c\u00f3d ag teast\u00e1il le linn log\u00e1la isteach. S\u00e1bh\u00e1il an eochair seo \u00e1it sh\u00e1bh\u00e1ilte.", // EN: If you lose access to your authenticator app you won't be able to sign in, because a code is required at login. Save this key somewhere safe.
    "Anahtar kopyaland\u0131 \u2713": "Eochair c\u00f3ipe\u00e1ilte \u2713", // EN: Key copied ✓
    "Kopyalanamad\u0131; anahtar\u0131 elle yaz.": "N\u00ed raibh s\u00e9 ind\u00e9anta an ch\u00f3ip\u00e1il a dh\u00e9anamh; cl\u00f3scr\u00edobh an eochair de l\u00e1imh.", // EN: Couldn't copy; type the key by hand.
