    "Hesab\u0131m\u0131 Sil": "Scrios Mo Chuntas", // EN: Delete My Account
    "Hesab\u0131n, profilin ve senkronize verilerin kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinir. Aktif NEXUS+ aboneli\u011fin varsa \u00f6nce Faturaland\u0131rma'dan iptal et. Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz.": "T\u00e1 do chuntas, pr\u00f3if\u00edl agus sonra\u00ed comhthreolchta scriosta go buan. M\u00e1 t\u00e1 s\u00ednti\u00fas NEXUS+ gn\u00edomhach agat, d\u00e9an \u00e9 a cheal\u00fa \u00f3 Bhille\u00e1il ar dt\u00fas. N\u00ed f\u00e9idir \u00e9 seo a thabhairt ar ais.", // EN: Your account, profile and synced data are permanently deleted. If you have an active NEXUS+ subscription, cancel it from Billing first. This cannot be undone.
    "Emin misin? Tekrar dokunarak sil": "An bhfuil t\u00fa cinnte? Tapaigh ar\u00eds chun scriosadh", // EN: Are you sure? Tap again to delete
    "Siliniyor\u2026": "Ag scriosadh\u2026", // EN: Deleting…
    "Hesap silindi. Aboneli\u011fini Whop hesab\u0131ndan iptal etmeyi unutma.": "Cuntas scriosta. Cuimhnigh do sh\u00ednti\u00fas a cheal\u00fa \u00f3 do chuntas Whop.", // EN: Account deleted. Remember to cancel your subscription from your Whop account.
    "Hesab\u0131n ve verilerin silindi.": "Scriosta\u00edodh do chuntas agus do shonra\u00ed.", // EN: Your account and data were deleted.
    "Bu cihazdaki NEXUS verilerini silmek i\u00e7in Ayarlar \u2192 \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Yap yeterli; bulut hesab\u0131 yok.": "Chun sonra\u00ed NEXUS a bhaint \u00f3n bhfeiste seo, n\u00edl le d\u00e9anamh ach Socruithe \u2192 Log\u00e1il Amach; n\u00edl cuntas scamall ann.", // EN: To remove NEXUS data on this device, Settings → Sign out is enough; there is no cloud account.
    "Hesap silme fonksiyonu hen\u00fcz da\u011f\u0131t\u0131lmad\u0131. \u015eimdilik \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yapabilirsin.": "N\u00edl an scriosadh cuntas ar thaobh an fhreastala\u00ed curtha i bhfeidhm go f\u00f3ill. F\u00e9adfaidh t\u00fa log\u00e1il amach anois.", // EN: The server-side account deletion isn't deployed yet. You can sign out for now.
    "! Rahats\u0131z etme modunu a\u00e7t\u0131m, hi\u00e7bir bildirim seni rahats\u0131z etmeyecek. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]": "! Chas m\u00e9 Do Not Disturb air; n\u00ed bheidh f\u00f3gra\u00ed ag cur isteach ort. [GN\u00cdOMH: CEADAIGH_DND]", // EN: ! I turned on Do Not Disturb; no notifications will bother you. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]
