    "Bu e-posta adresi ba\u015fka bir hesapta kay\u0131tl\u0131. Ba\u015fka bir adres dene.": "T\u00e1 an seoladh r\u00edomhphoist seo cl\u00e1raithe le cuntas eile. D\u00e9an iarracht le ceann eile.", // EN: This email address is registered to another account. Try a different one.
    "\u00c7ok s\u0131k denendi. Birka\u00e7 dakika sonra tekrar dene.": "R\u00f3-mheas\u00fanaithe. D\u00e9an iarracht ar\u00eds i gceann c\u00fapla n\u00f3im\u00e9ad.", // EN: Too many attempts. Try again in a few minutes.
