    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizler ve enerji odakl\u0131 cihazlar i\u00e7in h\u0131zl\u0131 tasarruf ak\u0131\u015flar\u0131.": "Sreafa\u00ed s\u00e1bh\u00e1la tapa do phl\u00faga\u00ed cliste agus do ghl\u00e9is\u00ed d\u00edrithe ar fhuinneamh.", // EN: Quick saving flows for smart plugs and energy-focused devices.
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizler ve enerji t\u00fcketen cihazlar\u0131 tek merkezde topla. Hemen uygulanabilen tasarruf profilleri ve zamanl\u0131 eko aksiyonlar\u0131 olu\u015ftur.": "Tabhair pl\u00faga\u00ed cliste agus gl\u00e9is\u00ed tomhad fuinnimh le ch\u00e9ile in aon \u00e1it amh\u00e1in. Cruthaigh pr\u00f3if\u00edl\u00ed s\u00e1bh\u00e1la l\u00e1ithreach agus gn\u00edomhartha \u00e9ice sceidealta.", // EN: Bring smart plugs and energy-consuming devices together in one place. Create instant saving profiles and scheduled eco actions.
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizleri ve enerji t\u00fcketen cihazlar\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir enerji tasarruf paneli olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma, eko profiller, zamanlanm\u0131\u015f tasarruf ve t\u00fcketim \u00f6zetleri ekle.": "Cruthaigh pain\u00e9al s\u00e1bh\u00e1la fuinnimh a bhainist\u00edonn pl\u00faga\u00ed cliste agus gl\u00e9is\u00ed tomhad fuinnimh. Cuir isteach m\u00fachadh tapa, pr\u00f3if\u00edl\u00ed \u00e9ice, s\u00e1bh\u00e1il sceidealta agus achoimre \u00fas\u00e1ide.", // EN: Create an energy saving panel that manages smart plugs and energy-consuming devices. Add quick shut-off, eco profiles, scheduled saving and usage summaries.
