    "Bilgilerini girdikten sonra g\u00f6nderilecek ad\u0131mlar\u0131 takip ederek \u015fifreni kolayca yenileyebilirsin.": "Tar \u00e9is do shonra\u00ed a chur isteach, is f\u00e9idir leat do phasfhocal a athshocr\u00fa go h\u00e9asca tr\u00ed na c\u00e9imeanna a sheolaimid a lean\u00faint.", // EN: After entering your details, you can easily reset your password by following the steps we send.
    "Bilgisayar\u0131nda NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 kullan; ayn\u0131 asistan ve kontroller orada da \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "\u00das\u00e1id aip deisce NEXUS ar do r\u00edomhaire; oibr\u00edonn an ch\u00fant\u00f3ir agus na rialuithe c\u00e9anna ansin freisin.", // EN: Use the NEXUS desktop app on your computer; the same assistant and controls work there too.
    "Bilgisayar\u0131ndan da sohbet et; konu\u015fmalar\u0131n t\u00fcm cihazlar\u0131nda senkronize kal\u0131r.": "Comhr\u00e1 \u00f3 do r\u00edomhaire freisin; fanann do chomhr\u00e1ite i gcomhthreo ar do ghl\u00e9asanna go l\u00e9ir.", // EN: Chat from your computer too; your conversations stay in sync across your devices.
    "Bir Eve Kat\u0131l": "B\u00ed p\u00e1irteach i mBaile", // EN: Join a Home
    "Bir cihaz a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda veya kapand\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Nuair a mh\u00fachann n\u00f3 a mh\u00fascailttear gl\u00e9as", // EN: When a device turns on or off
    "Bir cihaza dokununca panelin kontrol ekran\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r; ekranda yaln\u0131zca o cihaz\u0131n destekledi\u011fi \u00f6zellikler g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Shelly, WLED ve ESPHome cihazlar\u0131nda a\u00e7/kapat ve parlakl\u0131k do\u011frudan cihaza gider.": "Biorraigh ar ghl\u00e9as chun sc\u00e1ile\u00e1n rialaithe an phain\u00e9il a oscailt; n\u00ed thaispe\u00e1ntar ach na gn\u00e9ithe a thaca\u00edonn an gl\u00e9as sin leo. Maidir le gl\u00e9asanna Shelly, WLED agus ESPHome, t\u00e9ann an ciorruil\u00edonn/th\u00e9ann ar an bhfeidhm go d\u00edreach chuig an ngl\u00e9as.", // EN: Tap a device to open the panel's control screen; it shows only the features that device supports. For Shelly, WLED and ESPHome devices, on/off and brightness go straight to the device.
    "Bir eve kat\u0131l ekran\u0131nda bu kod kullan\u0131l\u0131r.": "\u00das\u00e1idtear an c\u00f3d seo ar an sc\u00e1ile\u00e1n Join a Home.", // EN: This code is used on the Join a Home screen.
    "Bir kez dokunman\u0131z yeterli": "N\u00edl ach bioradh amh\u00e1in de dh\u00edth air", // EN: One tap is all it takes
    "Bir plan olu\u015fturdu\u011funda saat ve aksiyonlar burada ger\u00e7ek verilerle g\u00f6r\u00fcnecek.": "Nuair a chrutha\u00edonn t\u00fa plean, beidh uaireanta agus gn\u00edomhartha le feice\u00e1il anseo le sonra\u00ed f\u00edor\u00fala.", // EN: Once you create a plan, times and actions will appear here with real data.
    "Bir plan olu\u015fturunca burada g\u00f6r\u00fcnecek.": "Dreoidh s\u00e9 anseo nuair a chrutha\u00edonn t\u00fa plean.", // EN: It will appear here once you create a plan.
