    "Br\u00fcksel": "Br\u00faisel", // EN: Brussels
    "Bu 8 haneli kod Apple HomeKit e\u015fle\u015ftirmesi i\u00e7indir ve yaln\u0131zca Apple Ev uygulamas\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Cihaz Shelly, WLED, Tasmota gibi yerel API destekliyorsa yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Is \u00e9 an c\u00f3d 8-dhigit seo le hathph\u00e9ire\u00e1il Apple HomeKit agus n\u00edl s\u00e9 ag obair ach leis an aip Apple Home. M\u00e1 thaca\u00edonn an gl\u00e9as le API \u00e1iti\u00fail cos\u00fail le Shelly, WLED n\u00f3 Tasmota, is f\u00e9idir \u00e9 a chur leis \u00f3n l\u00edonra \u00e1iti\u00falach.", // EN: This 8-digit code is for Apple HomeKit pairing and only works with the Apple Home app. If the device supports a local API such as Shelly, WLED or Tasmota, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu Cihaz": "An Gl\u00e9as Seo", // EN: This Device
    "Bu QR kodu bir Wi-Fi a\u011f\u0131na aittir, cihaz de\u011fildir. Cihaz\u0131 ayn\u0131 a\u011fa ba\u011flad\u0131ktan sonra yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "T\u00e1 an c\u00f3d QR seo mar chuid de l\u00edonra Wi-Fi, n\u00ed gl\u00e9as. Tar \u00e9is an gl\u00e9as a nascadh leis an l\u00edonra c\u00e9anna, is f\u00e9idir leat \u00e9 a chur leis \u00f3n l\u00edonra \u00e1iti\u00fail.", // EN: This QR code belongs to a Wi-Fi network, not a device. After connecting the device to the same network, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu adreste bilinen bir NEXUS cihaz\u0131 bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n ayn\u0131 a\u011fda ve a\u00e7\u0131k oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "N\u00edor aims\u00edodh aon ghl\u00e9as NEXUS ar eolas ag an seoladh seo. D\u00e9an cinnte go bhfuil an gl\u00e9as as agus ar an l\u00edonra c\u00e9anna.", // EN: No known NEXUS device was found at this address. Make sure the device is on and on the same network.
    "Bu ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulamay\u0131 olu\u015ftur:": "Cruthaigh an aip chliste seo:", // EN: Create this smart app:
    "Bu ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7in \u00f6nerilen \u00f6zellikler haz\u0131rlan\u0131yor.": "Ag ullmh\u00fa gn\u00e9ithe molta don sreabhadh seo.", // EN: Preparing suggested features for this flow.
    "Bu ayki tasarruf": "S\u00e1bh\u00e1ilte an mh\u00ed seo", // EN: Saved this month
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131.": "N\u00edor aims\u00edodh aon ghl\u00e9as taca\u00edochta ar an l\u00edonra seo.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network.
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da oldu\u011fundan emin ol; olmazsa a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan katalo\u011fu ya da QR / kurulum kodunu kullan.": "N\u00edor aims\u00edodh aon ghl\u00e9as taca\u00edochta ar an l\u00edonra seo. D\u00e9an cinnte go bhfuil an gl\u00e9as as agus ceangailte leis an Wi-Fi c\u00e9anna; murach sin, bain \u00fas\u00e1id as an gcatag\u00f3ir th\u00edos n\u00f3 c\u00f3d QR / socr\u00fa.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network. Make sure the device is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi; otherwise use the catalog below or a QR / setup code.
    "Bu cihaz i\u00e7in yerel koruma": "Cosaint \u00e1iti\u00fail don ghl\u00e9as seo", // EN: Local protection for this device
    "Bu cihaz s\u00fcr\u00fcm bilgisi payla\u015fm\u0131yor": "N\u00ed roinneann an gl\u00e9as seo eolas faoi leagan", // EN: This device doesn't share version info
    "Bu cihaz veya ba\u011flant\u0131 fener deste\u011fi sunmuyor.": "N\u00ed thaca\u00edonn an gl\u00e9as seo n\u00f3 an nasc leis an solas l\u00e1mhsholas.", // EN: This device or connection doesn't support the flashlight.
    "Bu cihazda otomatik konum deste\u011fi yok.": "N\u00ed thaca\u00edonn an gl\u00e9as seo le su\u00edomh uathoibr\u00edoch.", // EN: This device doesn't support automatic location.
    "Bu davet kodu bulunamad\u0131.": "N\u00edor aims\u00edodh an c\u00f3d cuireadh seo.", // EN: This invite code wasn't found.
    "Bu ekran, ekledi\u011fin ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 odalara g\u00f6re toplar; sahne kaydetti\u011finde \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n parlakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve tonu birlikte ayarlan\u0131r.": "Roinntear na feist\u00ed soilse a chuir t\u00fa leis ar an sc\u00e1ile\u00e1n seo de r\u00e9ir seomra; nuair a sh\u00e1bh\u00e1lann t\u00fa radharc, socra\u00edtear gile agus ton le ch\u00e9ile.", // EN: This screen groups the lighting devices you've added by room; when you save a scene, brightness and tone are set together.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir.": "Taispe\u00e1ntar na feist\u00ed a chuir t\u00fa leis an mbaile seo anseo.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir ve favori kartlar\u0131na ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Taispe\u00e1ntar na feist\u00ed a chuir t\u00fa leis an mbaile seo anseo agus ceangla\u00edtear iad le do chards is fearr leat.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here and linked to your favorite cards.
    "Bu evi ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silmek istedi\u011fine emin misin?": "An bhfuil t\u00fa cinnte gur mhaith leat an baile seo agus a shocruithe uile a scriosadh go buan?", // EN: Are you sure you want to permanently delete this home and all its settings?
    "Bu kod desteklenen bir cihaz kodu de\u011fil. Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini biliyorsan yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "N\u00edl an c\u00f3d seo ina ch\u00f3d feiste taca\u00edochta. M\u00e1 t\u00e1 a fhios agat seoladh IP na feiste, is f\u00e9idir leat \u00e9 a chur leis \u00f3 d\u2019fhreastala\u00ed \u00e1iti\u00fail.", // EN: This code isn't a supported device code. If you know the device's IP address, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu markalar yerel a\u011fdan kontrol edilir": "Rial\u00e1iltear na branda\u00ed seo thar d\u2019fhreastala\u00ed \u00e1iti\u00fail.", // EN: These brands are controlled over your local network
    "Bu mini uygulama resm\u00ee sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan sunulur.": "Tugtar an app bheag seo ag an sol\u00e1thra\u00ed oifigi\u00fail.", // EN: This mini app is provided by the official provider.
    "Bu ortam kamera eri\u015fimini desteklemiyor.": "N\u00ed thaca\u00edonn an timpeallacht seo le rochtain ceamara.", // EN: This environment doesn't support camera access.
    "Bu ortamda a\u011f taramas\u0131 kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor.": "N\u00ed bh\u00edonn scanadh l\u00edonra ar f\u00e1il anseo.", // EN: Network scanning isn't available here.
    "Bu ortamda g\u00fcvenli \u015fifreleme yok": "N\u00edl cripti\u00fa sl\u00e1n sa timpeallacht seo.", // EN: No secure encryption in this environment
    "Bu senaryo aktifle\u015fti\u011finde ilgili cihazlar otomatik olarak ayarlan\u0131r.": "Nuair a re\u00e1cht\u00e1lfar an radharc seo, d\u00e9antar na feist\u00ed gaolmhara a choigeart\u00fa go huathoibr\u00edoch.", // EN: When this scenario runs, the related devices are adjusted automatically.
    "Bu senaryodan etkilenen cihaz yok \u2014 \u00f6nce uygun cihaz ekle.": "N\u00ed f\u00e9idir le haon fheiste tionchar a bheith ag an gc\u00e1s seo \u2014 cuir feiste chu\u00ed leis ar dt\u00fas.", // EN: No devices are affected by this scenario — add a suitable device first.
    "Bu senaryoyu kullanmak i\u00e7in uyumlu cihaz eklemelisin.": "Caithfidh t\u00fa feiste chomhoiri\u00fanach a chur leis chun an c\u00e1s seo a \u00fas\u00e1id.", // EN: You need to add a compatible device to use this scenario.
    "Bu tek evin. Silersen bo\u015f bir \"Evim\" yeniden olu\u015fturulur. Devam edilsin mi?": "Seo d'aon bhaile. M\u00e1 scriosann t\u00fa \u00e9, cruth\u00f3far \"Mo Bhaile\" folamh ar\u00eds. Lean ar aghaidh?", // EN: This is your only home. If you delete it, an empty "My Home" will be created again. Continue?
