    "Bunu tam \u00e7\u00f6zemedim. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki formdan ekibimize geri bildirim g\u00f6nderirsen en k\u0131sa s\u00fcrede d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f yapal\u0131m; ya da \"Tam sohbeti a\u00e7\" ile devam edebilirsin.": "N\u00edorbh fh\u00e9idir liom r\u00e9iteach ioml\u00e1n a fh\u00e1il air. Seol \u00e1r bhfoireann aiseolas leis an bhfoirm th\u00edos agus freagrafaimid chomh luath agus is f\u00e9idir, n\u00f3 lean ar aghaidh le \"Comhr\u00e1 ioml\u00e1n oscailte\".", // EN: I couldn't fully solve that. Send our team feedback with the form below and we'll get back to you as soon as we can, or continue with "Open full chat".
