    "Cihazlar\u0131n durumu de\u011fi\u015fti\u011finde di\u011fer senaryolar\u0131 otomatik olarak tetikleyin.": "Sp\u00e1sanna eile a spreagadh go huathoibr\u00edoch nuair a athra\u00edonn st\u00e1das do ghl\u00e9is.", // EN: Trigger other scenarios automatically when your devices' status changes.
    "Cihazlar\u0131na dair i\u00e7g\u00f6r\u00fcler edin, stratejilerle otomatik tasarruf et.": "Faigh l\u00e9argais faoi do ghl\u00e9is\u00ed agus s\u00e1bh\u00e1il go huathoibr\u00edoch le strait\u00e9is\u00ed.", // EN: Get insights about your devices and save automatically with strategies.
    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 otomatik tarama, QR kod, kurulum kodu ya da manuel katalog ile ekleyebilirsin.": "Is f\u00e9idir leat do ghl\u00e9is\u00ed a chur leis le scanadh uathoibr\u00edoch, c\u00f3d QR, c\u00f3d socraithe n\u00f3 an catal\u00f3g l\u00e1imhe.", // EN: You can add your devices with automatic scan, QR code, setup code or the manual catalog.
    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131za dair i\u00e7g\u00f6r\u00fcler edinin ve enerji ipu\u00e7lar\u0131 al\u0131n.": "Faigh l\u00e9argais faoi do ghl\u00e9is\u00ed agus leideanna fuinnimh.", // EN: Get insights about your devices and energy tips.
