    "Cihaz\u0131m neden \u00e7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcyor?": "C\u00e9n f\u00e1th a bhfuil mo ghl\u00e9as le feice\u00e1il as l\u00edne?", // EN: Why does my device show as offline?
    "Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini yaz, NEXUS konu\u015fabildi\u011fi protokol\u00fc kendisi anlas\u0131n.": "Cl\u00f3scr\u00edobh seoladh IP an ghl\u00e9is agus aims\u00edonn NEXUS c\u00e9n pr\u00f3tacal a \u00fas\u00e1ideann s\u00e9.", // EN: Type the device's IP address and NEXUS figures out which protocol it speaks.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "Seice\u00e1il ceangal Wi-Fi an ghl\u00e9is agus do r\u00f3daire. M\u00e1 leanann an fhadhb, bain an gl\u00e9as agus cuir air ar\u00eds. C\u00e9imeanna: Gl\u00e9is\u00ed > roghnaigh an gl\u00e9as > Bain.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "Seice\u00e1il ceangal Wi-Fi an ghl\u00e9is agus do r\u00f3daire. M\u00e1 leanann an fhadhb, bain an gl\u00e9as \u00f3n aip NEXUS agus cuir air ar\u00eds.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "M\u00e1 n\u00ed thaispe\u00e1nann do ghl\u00e9as, bain \u00fas\u00e1id as scanadh QR n\u00f3 c\u00f3d socraithe. Is f\u00e9idir leat an leathanach cabhrach a oscailt chun taca\u00edocht agus treoir a fh\u00e1il.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "T\u00e1 seirbh\u00eds l\u00e1thair (GPS) do ghl\u00e9is d\u00edreach as. Cas air agus d\u00e9an iarracht ar\u00eds.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum servisini desteklemiyor.": "N\u00ed thaca\u00edonn do ghl\u00e9as le seirbh\u00eds\u00ed su\u00edomh.", // EN: Your device doesn't support location services.
    "Cihaz\u0131n listede yok mu? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "N\u00edl an gl\u00e9as sa liosta? Seol aiseolas", // EN: Device not on the list? Send feedback
    "Cihaz\u0131n yerel anahtar\u0131 gerekir \u2014 yak\u0131nda": "Teasta\u00edonn eochair \u00e1iti\u00fail an ghl\u00e9is \u2014 ag teacht go luath", // EN: Needs the device's local key — coming soon
