    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f": "Ag F\u00e1g\u00e1il an Bhaile", // EN: Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Kontrol\u00fc": "Seice\u00e1il F\u00e1g\u00e1la an Bhaile", // EN: Leaving Home Check
