    "Eve yakla\u015f\u0131rken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 a\u00e7, klimay\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r ve garaj kap\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 arac\u0131n\u0131n ekran\u0131ndan kontrol et.": "Cas ar na soilse, tosaigh an AC agus rialaigh doras an ghar\u00e1iste \u00f3 sc\u00e1ile\u00e1n do charr agus t\u00fa ag druidim abhaile.", // EN: Turn on the lights, start the AC and control the garage door from your car's screen as you approach home.
