    "Evet. NEXUS yerel \u00f6ncelikli \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r; cihaz verilerin bu cihazda kal\u0131r ve \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraflarla payla\u015f\u0131lmaz.": "T\u00e1. T\u00e1 NEXUS \u00e1iti\u00fail ar dt\u00fas; fanann do shonra\u00ed feiste ar an bhfeiste seo agus n\u00ed roinntear iad le tr\u00ed\u00fa p\u00e1irtithe.", // EN: Yes. NEXUS is local-first; your device data stays on this device and isn't shared with third parties.
