    "Bu hafta kayda de\u011fer bir etkinlik yok. Senaryo \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmalar\u0131 ve uyar\u0131lar burada toplan\u0131r.": "N\u00edl aon ghn\u00edomha\u00edocht suntasach an tseachtain seo. Ritheann radharc agus bail\u00edonn fol\u00e1irimh anseo.", // EN: No notable activity this week. Scene runs and alerts gather here.
