    "K\u00f6pr\u00fc S\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fc": "Leagan Droichead", // EN: Bridge Version
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fc, iOS cihaz\u0131nla ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da olmal\u0131. Bilgisayar a\u00e7\u0131k kald\u0131k\u00e7a e\u015fle\u015fme ge\u00e7erli kal\u0131r (tepsi/arka plan \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 destekler).": "Caithfidh an droichead a bheith ar an bhf\u00edse\u00e1n Wi-Fi c\u00e9anna le do ghl\u00e9as iOS. Fanann an p\u00e9ire\u00e1il bail\u00ed chomh fada agus a bh\u00edonn do r\u00edomhaire ar si\u00fal (taca\u00edocht do oibri\u00fa sa mhias/tr\u00e1cht c\u00falra).", // EN: The bridge has to be on the same Wi-Fi as your iOS device. The pairing stays valid as long as your computer stays awake (tray/background operation supported).
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcy\u00fc Ba\u015flat": "Tosaigh an droichead", // EN: Start the bridge
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcdeki yuvarlak d\u00fc\u011fmeye bas, sonra tekrar dene.": "Br\u00faigh an cnaipe cruinn ar an droichead, ansin d\u00e9an iarracht ar\u00eds.", // EN: Press the round button on the bridge, then try again.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcn\u00fcn \u00fcst\u00fcndeki yuvarlak d\u00fc\u011fmeye bas, ard\u0131ndan 30 saniye i\u00e7inde \u201cK\u00f6pr\u00fcy\u00fc ba\u011fla\u201dya dokun.": "Br\u00faigh an cnaipe cruinn ar bharr an droichead, ansin sconna \"Ceangail an droichead\" laistigh de 30 soicind.", // EN: Press the round button on top of the bridge, then tap “Connect bridge” within 30 seconds.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcye ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol ve tekrar dene.": "N\u00edorbh fh\u00e9idir ceangal leis an droichead. D\u00e9an cinnte go bhfuil t\u00fa ar an l\u00edonra c\u00e9anna agus d\u00e9an iarracht ar\u00eds.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the bridge. Make sure you're on the same network and try again.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcye ba\u011fl\u0131 lamba bulunamad\u0131.": "N\u00edor aims\u00edodh aon lampa\u00ed ceangailte leis an droichead.", // EN: No lamps connected to the bridge were found.
