    "Misafir geldi\u011fi anda giri\u015f, ayd\u0131nlatma ve ortak alan cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 haz\u0131rlayan bir misafir modu uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. Kar\u015f\u0131lama \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131, sessiz bildirim ve misafir eri\u015fim ad\u0131mlar\u0131 olsun.": "Cruthaigh app m\u00f3d aoi a ullmha\u00edonn an bealach isteach, an solas agus na gl\u00e9asanna i limist\u00e9ar roinnte nuair a theachtar na n-a\u00edonna. \u00c1irigh solas f\u00e1ilte, f\u00f3gra\u00ed ci\u00faine agus c\u00e9imeanna rochtana aoi.", // EN: Create a guest mode app that prepares the entrance, lighting and shared-area devices as soon as guests arrive. Include a welcome light, quiet notifications and guest access steps.
    "Misafir geldi\u011fi anda kullan\u0131lacak \u0131\u015f\u0131k, eri\u015fim ve ortam ayarlar\u0131.": "Socruithe solais, rochtana agus atmaisf\u00e9ar le h\u00fas\u00e1id l\u00e1ithreach nuair a shroicheann a\u00edonna.", // EN: Light, access and ambience settings to use as soon as guests arrive.
    "Misafir gelmeden \u00f6nce giri\u015f, ayd\u0131nlatma, ortak alan ve e\u011flence cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde haz\u0131rla. Ev i\u00e7inde rahat ama g\u00fcvenli bir kar\u015f\u0131lama ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 olu\u015ftur.": "Ullmhaigh an t-iontr\u00e1il, solas, limist\u00e9ir roinnte agus gl\u00e9asanna siamsa\u00edochta ar phain\u00e9al amh\u00e1in roimh theacht na n-a\u00edonna. Cruthaigh sreabhadh f\u00e1ilteaithe socair ach sl\u00e1n sa teach.", // EN: Prepare the entrance, lighting, shared areas and entertainment devices on one panel before guests arrive. Create a relaxed but secure welcome flow at home.
