    "NEXUS'u di\u011fer platformlara ba\u011flayarak cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 her yerden kontrol et.": "Ceangail NEXUS le hard\u00e1in eile chun do ghl\u00e9is\u00ed a rial\u00fa \u00f3 \u00e1it ar bith.", // EN: Connect NEXUS to other platforms to control your devices from anywhere.
    "Bu hizmet ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131 hen\u00fcz kullan\u0131labilir de\u011fil. \u00dc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraf cihazlar i\u00e7in Entegrasyonlar'dan Home Assistant'\u0131 kullanabilirsin.": "N\u00edl na nascanna seirbh\u00edse seo ar f\u00e1il go f\u00f3ill. Maidir le gairis tri\u00fa-p\u00e1irt\u00ed, is f\u00e9idir leat Home Assistant a \u00fas\u00e1id \u00f3 Ionchuardach.", // EN: These service connections are not available yet. For third-party devices, you can use Home Assistant from Integrations.
    "NEXUS+ Ayl\u0131k": "NEXUS+ M\u00edos\u00fail", // EN: NEXUS+ Monthly
