    "NEXUS+ hen\u00fcz sat\u0131\u015fta de\u011fil. Cihaz ekleme, kontrol panelleri, senaryolar ve NEXUS AI \u015fu an tamamen \u00fccretsiz; abonelik a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda buradan haber verece\u011fiz.": "N\u00edl NEXUS+ ar d\u00edol go f\u00f3ill. T\u00e1 s\u00e9 go hioml\u00e1n saor in aisce feist\u00ed, c\u00e1sanna agus NEXUS AI a chur leis anois; cuirfimid ar an eolas th\u00fa anseo nuair a oscla\u00edtear s\u00ednti\u00fas.", // EN: NEXUS+ isn't on sale yet. Adding devices, scenarios and NEXUS AI are completely free right now; we'll let you know here when subscriptions open.
    "NEXUS+ yak\u0131nda": "NEXUS+ ag teacht go luath", // EN: NEXUS+ coming soon
    "NEXUS, \u00e7er\u00e7eve i\u00e7indeki kodu otomatik alg\u0131lar ve e\u015fle\u015fmeyi ba\u015flat\u0131r.": "Aims\u00edonn NEXUS c\u00f3d anona inside an fr\u00e1ma go huathoibr\u00edoch agus tosa\u00edonn s\u00e9 ag p\u00e9ire\u00e1il.", // EN: NEXUS detects the code inside the frame automatically and starts pairing.
