    "Bu adreste bir cihaz var ama NEXUS protokol\u00fc konu\u015fmuyor.": "T\u00e1 feiste ag an seoladh seo, ach n\u00ed labhra\u00edonn s\u00ed pr\u00f3tacal NEXUS.", // EN: There is a device at this address, but it does not speak a NEXUS protocol.
    "Bu cihaz zaten ekli.": "T\u00e1 an feiste seo curtha leis cheana.", // EN: This device is already added.
    "E\u015fle\u015ftir ve ekle": "P\u00e9ire\u00e1il agus cur leis", // EN: Pair and add
    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "N\u00edl an c\u00f3d p\u00e9ire\u00e1la bail\u00ed. Cuir isteach an c\u00f3d 11-dh\u00e1ta n\u00f3 an t-\u00e1bhar QR a thosa\u00edonn le MT:.", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "Cuir isteach an c\u00f3d seo sa aip deisce NEXUS. M\u00e1 t\u00e1 an feiste ar Wi-Fi, is f\u00e9idir \u00e9 a chur leis freisin \u00f3n l\u00edonra \u00e1iti\u00fail tr\u00edna sheoladh IP.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "T\u00e1 an feiste \u00e1 lorg ar an l\u00edonra c\u00e9anna agus \u00e1 p\u00e9ire\u00e1il. F\u00e9adfaidh s\u00e9 seo suas le n\u00f3im\u00e9ad amh\u00e1in a th\u00f3g\u00e1il; n\u00ed m\u00f3r don fheiste bheith ar si\u00fal agus i m\u00f3d p\u00e9ire\u00e1la.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "N\u00edor aims\u00edodh an gl\u00e9as n\u00f3 n\u00edorbh fh\u00e9idir \u00e9 a ph\u00e9ire\u00e1il. D\u00e9an cinnte go bhfuil s\u00e9 ar an l\u00edonra c\u00e9anna, go bhfuil s\u00e9 cumhachtach agus i m\u00f3d p\u00e9ire\u00e1la.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "N\u00edor aims\u00edodh an gl\u00e9as. D\u00e9an cinnte go bhfuil s\u00e9 ar an l\u00edonra c\u00e9anna, go bhfuil s\u00e9 cumhachtach agus i m\u00f3d p\u00e9ire\u00e1la. D'fh\u00e9adfadh balla d\u00f3ite\u00e1in do r\u00edomhaire a bheith ag cur bac ar fhreagra\u00ed \u00f3 ghl\u00e9asanna ar an l\u00edonra \u00e1iti\u00fail.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "N\u00edorbh fh\u00e9idir an gl\u00e9as a ph\u00e9ire\u00e1il. Seice\u00e1il an c\u00f3d p\u00e9ire\u00e1la agus go bhfuil an gl\u00e9as i m\u00f3d p\u00e9ire\u00e1la.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "P\u00e9ire\u00e1ladh an gl\u00e9as ach n\u00edl aon fheidhm ann is f\u00e9idir le NEXUS a rial\u00fa.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "N\u00edor fhreagair an gl\u00e9as. D\u00e9an cinnte go bhfuil s\u00e9 cumhachtach agus ar an l\u00edonra c\u00e9anna.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
