    "TV odas\u0131 i\u00e7in k\u0131s\u0131k parlakl\u0131kta sinema sahnesi olu\u015ftur.": "Cruthaigh radharc scann\u00e1in lagaithe don seomra teilif\u00edse.", // EN: Create a dimmed cinema scene for the TV room.
    "TV ve medya cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in bir sinema modu uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. Film ba\u015flat, ses seviyesi, ortam \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve dikkat da\u011f\u0131tmayan gece e\u011flence k\u0131sayollar\u0131 olsun.": "Cruthaigh aip m\u00f3d scann\u00e1in do theilif\u00edse\u00e1in agus do ghl\u00e9is me\u00e1n. Cuir san \u00e1ireamh t\u00fas scann\u00e1n, toirt, soilse timpeallachta agus gearrth\u00f3ga siamsa\u00edochta o\u00edche gan mearbhall.", // EN: Create a cinema mode app for TVs and media devices. Include start movie, volume, ambient lights and distraction-free evening entertainment shortcuts.
    "TV ve medya cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in tek dokunu\u015flu e\u011flence paneli.": "Pain\u00e9al siamsa\u00edochta le l\u00e1mh amh\u00e1in do theilif\u00edse\u00e1in agus do ghl\u00e9is me\u00e1n.", // EN: One-tap entertainment panel for TVs and media devices.
    "TV, hoparl\u00f6r ve e\u011flence cihazlar\u0131": "Teilif\u00edse\u00e1in, cainteoir\u00ed agus gl\u00e9is siamsa\u00edochta", // EN: TVs, speakers and entertainment devices
    "TV, medya kutusu ve ortam \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 tek aksiyonda birle\u015ftir. Film ba\u015flat, gece modu ve dikkat da\u011f\u0131tmayan e\u011flence sahneleri kolayca kurulabilsin.": "Comhcheangail an teilif\u00eds, bosca me\u00e1n agus soilse timpeallachta i ngn\u00edomh amh\u00e1in. D\u00e9an \u00e9 \u00e9asca a bhun\u00fa t\u00fas scann\u00e1n, m\u00f3d o\u00edche agus radhairc siamsa\u00edochta gan mearbhall.", // EN: Combine the TV, media box and ambient lights in one action. Make it easy to set up start movie, night mode and distraction-free entertainment scenes.
    "Tabii ki! Senin i\u00e7in harika bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 senaryo kurgulayabilirim. Bana biraz detay verir misin? \u00d6rne\u011fin: \"Sabah uyand\u0131\u011f\u0131mda kahve makinesi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fs\u0131n\" veya \"Film izlerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar tamamen k\u0131s\u0131ls\u0131n\" gibi bir istekte bulunabilirsin.": "Ar nd\u00f3igh! Is f\u00e9idir liom c\u00e1s cliste iontach a chur le ch\u00e9ile duit. An bhf\u00e9adf\u00e1 c\u00fapla sonra\u00ed a thabhairt dom? Mar shampla: \"T\u00fas a chur leis an meais\u00edn caife nuair a dh\u00fais\u00edm\" n\u00f3 \"Laghd\u00fa ioml\u00e1n ar na soilse nuair a bh\u00edm ag f\u00e9achaint ar scann\u00e1n\".", // EN: Of course! I can put together a great smart scenario for you. Could you give me a few details? For example: "Start the coffee machine when I wake up" or "Dim the lights fully when I watch a movie".
