    "Uyku i\u00e7in daha dengeli bir gece iklim profili uygula.": "Cuir pr\u00f3if\u00edl aer\u00e1ide o\u00edche n\u00edos cothroime i bhfeidhm don chodladh.", // EN: Apply a more balanced night climate profile for sleep.
