    "Uyan\u0131nca \u0131\u015f\u0131k, perde, iklim ve m\u00fczi\u011fi tek dokunu\u015fla ba\u015flat.": "Tosaigh solais, dall\u00f3ga, aerch\u00f3iri\u00fa agus ceol le sconna amh\u00e1in nuair a dh\u00fais\u00edonn t\u00fa.", // EN: Start lights, blinds, climate and music with one tap when you wake up.
