    "Ev bo\u015fken tasarruf, taklit hareket ve uyar\u0131 tek panelde.": "S\u00e1bh\u00e1lacha, l\u00e1thair bhr\u00e9agach agus rabhadh i bpain\u00e9al amh\u00e1in agus an teach folamh.", // EN: Savings, simulated presence and alerts in one panel while the home is empty.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrge ve temizlik cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in g\u00fcn ve oda plan\u0131.": "Pleananna lae agus seomra do thu\u00e1ill\u00ed r\u00f3bataice agus gl\u00e9asanna glantach\u00e1in.", // EN: Day and room plans for robot vacuums and cleaning devices.
    "Sulama saatleri, b\u00f6lgeler ve sens\u00f6r verisiyle ak\u0131ll\u0131 plan.": "Sceidil uisce cliste, limist\u00e9ir agus plean\u00e1il tiom\u00e1inte ag braiteoir\u00ed.", // EN: Smart watering schedules, zones and sensor-driven planning.
    "Sens\u00f6r verisiyle havaland\u0131rma ve temizleyiciyi otomatik y\u00f6net.": "Bainistigh aer\u00e1il agus glant\u00f3ir\u00ed go huathoibr\u00edoch \u00f3 shonra\u00ed braiteora.", // EN: Manage ventilation and purifiers automatically from sensor data.
    "\u00c7al\u0131\u015f\u0131rken sessizlik, do\u011fru \u0131\u015f\u0131k ve bildirim aras\u0131.": "Ci\u00fain, solas oiri\u00fanach agus gan cur isteach agus t\u00fa ag obair.", // EN: Quiet, proper lighting and no interruptions while you work.
