    "Yatak odas\u0131": "Seomra Leapa", // EN: Bedroom
    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce gerekli t\u00fcm ev kontrollerini tek merkezde topla. I\u015f\u0131k azaltma, rahats\u0131z etme, kilit kontrol\u00fc ve gece iklim ayarlar\u0131 tek ekranda y\u00f6netilsin.": "Bailigh na seice\u00e1lacha baile go l\u00e9ir a theasta\u00edonn uait sula dteann t\u00fa a chodladh i l\u00e1r l\u00e1rnach amh\u00e1in. Moill soilse, n\u00e1 cur isteach, seice\u00e1il d\u00fanadh agus socruithe aer\u00e1ide o\u00edche ar sc\u00e1ile\u00e1n amh\u00e1in.", // EN: Gather all the home checks you need before bed in one center. Dim lights, do not disturb, lock check and night climate settings on one screen.
    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce \u0131\u015f\u0131k, sessiz mod, kilit ve iklim ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir uykuya haz\u0131rl\u0131k merkezi olu\u015ftur. Son kontrol \u00f6zeti ve tek dokunu\u015f gece modu ekle.": "Cruthaigh l\u00e1rionad ullmh\u00fach\u00e1in le haghaidh codlata a bhainist\u00edonn soilse, m\u00f3d ci\u00faine, glasanna agus aerch\u00f3iri\u00fa sular t\u00e9ann t\u00fa a chodladh. Cuir achoimre deireanach seice\u00e1il agus m\u00f3d o\u00edche le tap amh\u00e1in.", // EN: Create a bedtime preparation center that manages lights, quiet mode, locks and climate before bed. Add a final check summary and one-tap night mode.
