    "\u0130ptal \u015fu an tamamlanamad\u0131. Biraz sonra yeniden dene.": "N\u00edorbh fh\u00e9idir an ceal\u00fa a chr\u00edochn\u00fa. D\u00e9an iarracht ar\u00eds i gceann n\u00f3im\u00e9ad.", // EN: Cancellation could not be completed. Try again in a moment.
