    "\u015eifreyi Kaydet": "S\u00e1bh\u00e1il Pasfhocal", // EN: Save Password
    "Google ile giri\u015f \u015fu anda kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor. E-posta ve \u015fifreyle giri\u015f yap; Google ile hesap a\u00e7t\u0131ysan \u201c\u015eifremi Unuttum\u201d ile bir \u015fifre belirleyebilirsin.": "N\u00edl s\u00edn isteach Google ar f\u00e1il faoi l\u00e1thair. S\u00edn isteach le r\u00edomhphost agus pasfhocal; m\u00e1 chruthaigh t\u00fa do chuntas le Google, bain \u00fas\u00e1ide as \u201cPasfhocal Dearmadta\u201d chun pasfhocal a shocr\u00fa.", // EN: Google sign-in isn't available right now. Sign in with email and password; if you created your account with Google, use “Forgot Password” to set a password.
