    "\u0130ptal ve \u00f6deme y\u00f6ntemi de\u011fi\u015fikli\u011fi g\u00fcvenli \u00f6deme sayfam\u0131z Whop \u00fczerinden yap\u0131l\u0131r. \u0130ptal edersen mevcut d\u00f6nemin sonuna kadar kullanmaya devam edersin ve bir sonraki \u00f6deme al\u0131nmaz.": "B\u00edonn ceal\u00fa agus athr\u00fa do mhodh \u00edoca\u00edochta ar \u00e1r leathanach seice\u00e1la sl\u00e1n, Whop. M\u00e1 cheala\u00edonn t\u00fa, coinn\u00edonn t\u00fa ag \u00fas\u00e1id NEXUS+ go deireadh na tr\u00e9imhse reatha agus n\u00ed th\u00f3gtar an ch\u00e9ad \u00edoca\u00edocht eile riamh.", // EN: Cancelling and changing your payment method happen on our secure checkout page, Whop. If you cancel, you keep using NEXUS+ until the end of the current period and the next payment is never taken.
    "Aboneli\u011fin yok. NEXUS+ i\u00e7in Plus sayfas\u0131ndan \u00fccretsiz deneyebilirsin.": "N\u00edl s\u00ednti\u00fas agat. Bain triail as NEXUS+ saor in aisce \u00f3n leathanach Plus.", // EN: You don't have a subscription. Try NEXUS+ free from the Plus page.
    "QR, kurulum kodu veya manuel katalog ile ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Taispe\u00e1ntar na gl\u00e9asanna a mh\u00e9ada\u00edonn t\u00fa tr\u00ed QR, c\u00f3d socraithe n\u00f3 an catal\u00f3g l\u00e1imhe anseo.", // EN: Devices you add by QR, setup code or the manual catalog show up here.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrge kontrol paneli \u00b7 ba\u015flat, durdur, eve d\u00f6n": "Pain\u00e9al rialaithe robot fol\u00fasghlant\u00f3ir \u00b7 t\u00fas, stad, filleadh abhaile", // EN: Robot vacuum control panel · start, stop, return home
