    "Priz ve enerji kontrol paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7, kapat, t\u00fcketim": "Pain\u00e9al plug agus fuinnimh \u00b7 ar, as, tomhaltas", // EN: Plug and energy control panel · on, off, consumption
    "Ula\u015f\u0131m ve takip paneli \u00b7 konum, \u015farj": "Pain\u00e9al iompar agus rianaithe \u00b7 su\u00edomh, muirear", // EN: Transport and tracking panel · location, charge
