    "Bu ad ana sayfa kart\u0131nda ve cihaz listesinde g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Taispe\u00e1nann an t-ainm seo ar an gc\u00e1rta baile agus sa liosta gl\u00e9asanna.", // EN: This name shows on the home card and in the device list.
