    "Bu hesapta hen\u00fcz \u015fifre yok": "N\u00edl pasfhocal ag an gcuntas seo f\u00f3s", // EN: This account has no password yet
    "\u015eifren belirlendi \u2713": "T\u00e1 do phasfhocal socraithe \u2713", // EN: Your password is set ✓
    "Bu hesap Google ile a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131, i\u00e7inde hen\u00fcz bir \u015fifre yok. \u0130lk \u015fifreni burada belirleyebilirsin; bundan sonra e-posta ve \u015fifreyle de giri\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Oscla\u00edodh an cuntas seo le Google agus n\u00edl pasfhocal aige f\u00f3s. Socraigh do ch\u00e9ad phasfhocal anseo; tar \u00e9is sin is f\u00e9idir leat s\u00edni\u00fa isteach freisin le r-phost agus pasfhocal.", // EN: This account was opened with Google and has no password yet. Set your first password here; after that you can also sign in with email and password.
    "\u015eifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 e-postama g\u00f6nder": "Seol chugam nasc socruithe pasfhocal", // EN: Email me a password setup link
    "Bu i\u015flem ek do\u011frulama istiyor. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan \u015fifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 isteyebilirsin.": "T\u00e1 deimhnithe breise ag teast\u00e1il don ghn\u00edomh seo. Is f\u00e9idir leat iarratas a dh\u00e9anamh ar nasc socruithe pasfhocal th\u00edos.", // EN: This action needs extra verification. You can request a password setup link below.
    "\u015eifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 e-postana g\u00f6nderildi \u2713": "Nasc socruithe pasfhocal seolta chuig do bhosca isteach \u2713", // EN: Password setup link sent to your inbox ✓
    "\u015eifre ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 \u015fu anda g\u00f6nderilemiyor.": "N\u00ed f\u00e9idir an nasc pasfhocal a sheoladh faoi l\u00e1thair.", // EN: The password link can't be sent right now.
    "Giri\u015f e-postan bulunamad\u0131; \u00f6nce giri\u015f yap.": "N\u00edor aims\u00edomar do r-phost s\u00ednithe isteach; s\u00edni\u00fa isteach ar dt\u00fas.", // EN: We couldn't find your sign-in email; sign in first.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131 g\u00f6nderilemedi. Birazdan tekrar dene.": "N\u00edorbh fh\u00e9idir an nasc a sheoladh. D\u00e9an iarracht ar\u00eds i n\u00f3im\u00e9ad.", // EN: The link couldn't be sent. Try again in a moment.
